 ## Models
 
 Freebuff includes a curated model catalog. The regular picker currently offers:
 
 | Model                       | Access                  | Best for                                                          |
 | --------------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
 | **GLM 5.3 Flash**           | Full and limited access | The default everywhere; deepest reasoning, unmetered              |
